                                <strong>></strong> Any other item not specifically included in the tour itinerary.',
                'full_description_html' => '<strong>Our Egypt "Land Of Pharaohs" African Heritage Tour</strong> includes an unforgettable 4-Day luxury cruise on the 
                    River Nile; visits to the Great Pyramids and a close up look at the famous Sphinx. We will explore the Egyptian Museum of Antiquities where over 
                    250,000 artifacts illustrating over 5000 years of Egyptian history are on display. This museum houses the King Tutankhamen collection of treasures, 
                    gold and jewelry that were enclosed in his tomb for over 3,500 years before it was discovered in the 1920’s.<br><br>We will tour Alexandria, 
